# Build and publish

After finishing a set of code changes in this repo, always:

1. Run `npm run build` and fix any failures before deploying.
2. Publish to production with `npx vercel deploy --prod --yes` from the project root (linked as `pepecat`).
3. Report the production URL when the deploy finishes.

Do this without being asked again. Do not skip the production deploy after user-facing changes. Preview-only deploys are not enough.
